title: ninja_duelist
---
Duelist: The Leader is meditating. Try not to slam the door. What do you want?
-> What work does your clan do?
    <<jump ninja_duelist__1>>
-> What do you know about Badely?
    <<jump ninja_duelist__2>>
-> Have you heard of Kagero?
    Duelist: The woman with the white scarf. Shadow Oni has never given her orders. Doubt she'd take any.
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_duelist__1
---
Duelist: Right now we're guarding a shipment for the Gate Authority. The Leader is waiting to hear from some employers in the Business Dimension. In the meantime, I have a watch to stand.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_duelist>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_duelist__2
---
Duelist: He rides a burning shark better than anyone I've fought. Last time I watched the rail for boarders, he came up from underneath it.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_duelist>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_leader
---
Shadow Oni: You came in without invitation. I have not decided whether that was nerve or skill. I am Zorlack 65536, leader of the Shadow Clan. What brings you here?
-> What work are you doing?
    <<jump ninja_leader__1>>
-> What do you want to do in the Business Dimension?
    <<jump ninja_leader__2>>
-> Where does the dojo stand on the cove?
    <<jump ninja_leader__3>>
-> Does Kagero belong to your dojo?
    <<jump ninja_leader__kagero>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__1
---
Shadow Oni: The Gate Authority hired us to guard a shipment. I have sent applications to employers in the Business Dimension, and while I wait for a reply, my clan and I need to earn a living.
Shadow Oni: Badely is preparing a raid. I would prefer that you not carry news of our plans to the cove.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__2
---
Shadow Oni: On my first visit, a man at the careers office asked me what sort of work I wanted. Nobody had ever asked me that before.
Shadow Oni: I have led this clan for years. I am rather curious what else I might be good at. For the moment I would settle for an interview.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_leader__3
---
Shadow Oni: We made peace with the pirates generations ago. Badely sees an opportunity in the cargo, and we have agreed to protect it. I expect a difficult passage.
Shadow Oni: He is an excellent captain. I have no wish to resume the wars over a consignment of freight.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===

title: ninja_heavy
---
Ninja Heavy: The Leader opens the far door. The heavy one closes it. Speak.
-> Why do they call you the heavy one?
    <<jump ninja_heavy__1>>
-> What do you do on a cargo ship?
    <<jump ninja_heavy__2>>
-> Do you ever speak to the pirates?
    Ninja Heavy: I went to watch Bess load a cannon. She shouted at the powder until someone lit it.
    Ninja Heavy: Her crew lived. I learned something.
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_heavy__1
---
Ninja Heavy: The Duelist is not there when you strike. The heavy one is there. It changes nothing.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_heavy>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_heavy__2
---
Ninja Heavy: I stand between the cargo and the boarders. The captain asked me to stand nearer the centre of the deck. Something about the ship's trim.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_heavy>>
-> Carry on.
===

title: ninja_leader__kagero
---
Shadow Oni: Kagero went after the spirits at Castle Godwin. I offered her two of my people. She declined.
Shadow Oni: We sent bandages anyway. No idea if she took them.
-> Ask another question.
    <<jump ninja_leader>>
-> Open the arena door.
===
